Z||000003||Wolfhound||04-10-2001||07:28 AM||||You have to remove the wiper arms and the plastic vent cover below the windshield,also.<P> It helps to loosen the rear innerfender 7mm screws and the rear top fender 10mm bolts. this allows you to pull the corner of the fender out a bit for better access when removing the old one.||||reg||1
